    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/0d8e6c5b836c132db29ef6b8f5d0bbd2.avif?t=1755205075\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Presidential Rise</strong> is a political strategy and management sim where you lead a rising nation as its newly elected president. Balance economic growth, public satisfaction, and political stability while facing mounting pressure from a powerful billionaire antagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make high-stakes decisions, respond to shifting citizen demands, and navigate a web of policies, crises, and conflicting interests. Every choice you make shapes your nation\u2014and your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/c0c5edec0666ec3e7a711cb2caf8da6a.poster.avif?t=1755205075\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/c0c5edec0666ec3e7a711cb2caf8da6a.webm?t=1755205075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/c0c5edec0666ec3e7a711cb2caf8da6a.mp4?t=1755205075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you lead with integrity, or give in to the forces pulling the strings?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/5c8ab1ca18d4b33f72a4bcb4e1ad5572.avif?t=1755205075\" width=616 height=85 /></span><br> \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Decision-Making</strong> \u2013 Enact policies, give interviews, and steer national direction through tough moral and political choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/48ac2b680b2cd3f0242463387db13414.poster.avif?t=1755205075\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/48ac2b680b2cd3f0242463387db13414.webm?t=1755205075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/48ac2b680b2cd3f0242463387db13414.mp4?t=1755205075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Evolving Requests &amp; Infrastructure</strong> \u2013 Expand infrastructure and address the changing needs of your people across each playthrough.<br><br>\ud83d\udcca <strong>Popularity &amp; Power Balance</strong> \u2013 Keep different community groups satisfied\u2014or risk losing control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/648ed6c5b77bf27497f20e82aa3b4d05.poster.avif?t=1755205075\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/648ed6c5b77bf27497f20e82aa3b4d05.webm?t=1755205075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/648ed6c5b77bf27497f20e82aa3b4d05.mp4?t=1755205075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Economic &amp; Export Systems</strong> \u2013 Manage trade, resources, and financial health under constant pressure.<br><br>\u2696\ufe0f <strong>Crisis &amp; Corruption Management</strong> \u2013 Investigate scandals, handle emergencies, and protect your administration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/c0dfab26c2135df58ff1cb49e5523322.poster.avif?t=1755205075\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/c0dfab26c2135df58ff1cb49e5523322.webm?t=1755205075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/c0dfab26c2135df58ff1cb49e5523322.mp4?t=1755205075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83c\udfad <strong>Political Dilemmas &amp; Opposition</strong> \u2013 Face a powerful rival and make tough political decisions where your leadership ideals are constantly challenged through media confrontations and public expectations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Take the oath. Stand your ground. <strong>The future of your nation begins with you.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/0d8e6c5b836c132db29ef6b8f5d0bbd2.avif?t=1755205075\" width=616 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Presidential Rise</strong> is a political strategy and management sim where you lead a rising nation as its newly elected president. Balance economic growth, public satisfaction, and political stability while facing mounting pressure from a powerful billionaire antagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make high-stakes decisions, respond to shifting citizen demands, and navigate a web of policies, crises, and conflicting interests. Every choice you make shapes your nation\u2014and your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/c0c5edec0666ec3e7a711cb2caf8da6a.poster.avif?t=1755205075\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/c0c5edec0666ec3e7a711cb2caf8da6a.webm?t=1755205075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/c0c5edec0666ec3e7a711cb2caf8da6a.mp4?t=1755205075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you lead with integrity, or give in to the forces pulling the strings?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/5c8ab1ca18d4b33f72a4bcb4e1ad5572.avif?t=1755205075\" width=616 height=85 /></span><br> \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Decision-Making</strong> \u2013 Enact policies, give interviews, and steer national direction through tough moral and political choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/48ac2b680b2cd3f0242463387db13414.poster.avif?t=1755205075\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/48ac2b680b2cd3f0242463387db13414.webm?t=1755205075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/48ac2b680b2cd3f0242463387db13414.mp4?t=1755205075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Evolving Requests &amp; Infrastructure</strong> \u2013 Expand infrastructure and address the changing needs of your people across each playthrough.<br><br>\ud83d\udcca <strong>Popularity &amp; Power Balance</strong> \u2013 Keep different community groups satisfied\u2014or risk losing control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/648ed6c5b77bf27497f20e82aa3b4d05.poster.avif?t=1755205075\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/648ed6c5b77bf27497f20e82aa3b4d05.webm?t=1755205075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/648ed6c5b77bf27497f20e82aa3b4d05.mp4?t=1755205075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Economic &amp; Export Systems</strong> \u2013 Manage trade, resources, and financial health under constant pressure.<br><br>\u2696\ufe0f <strong>Crisis &amp; Corruption Management</strong> \u2013 Investigate scandals, handle emergencies, and protect your administration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/c0dfab26c2135df58ff1cb49e5523322.poster.avif?t=1755205075\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/c0dfab26c2135df58ff1cb49e5523322.webm?t=1755205075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/c0dfab26c2135df58ff1cb49e5523322.mp4?t=1755205075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83c\udfad <strong>Political Dilemmas &amp; Opposition</strong> \u2013 Face a powerful rival and make tough political decisions where your leadership ideals are constantly challenged through media confrontations and public expectations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Take the oath. Stand your ground. <strong>The future of your nation begins with you.</strong></p>",
